---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import HotelRow from '../components/HotelRow.astro';import {hotels} from '../data/hotels';
export function getStaticPaths(){const pages=[{slug:'north-goa-hotels',region:'North Goa',label:'North Goa hotels',intro:'Four selected stays span Sinquerim-Candolim, Nerul, Vagator and Calangute. These are separate bases along the wider North Goa beach circuit; choose by the property and beach you plan to use.'},{slug:'south-goa-hotels',region:'South Goa',label:'South Goa hotels',intro:'A shortlist for travellers considering resort stays and the slower coastal settings around Arossim, Majorda, Colva and Benaulim.'},{slug:'central-goa-stays',region:'Central Goa',label:'Central Goa stays',intro:'An editorial central Goa grouping: a city base in Panaji and an independent riverside stay in Goa Velha. Consider these for city, heritage or inland plans rather than a beach-first itinerary; “central Goa” is not an administrative region.'}];
return pages.map(p=>({params:{region:p.slug},props:{page:p}}));}
const {page}=Astro.props;const matches=hotels.filter(h=>h.region===page.region);const title=`${page.label} to consider | Goa, Considered`;const checkedDates=[...new Set(matches.map(h=>h.checked))];const checkedLabel=checkedDates.length===1?`Official sources checked ${new Date(checkedDates[0]+'T12:00:00Z').toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'})}`:'See individual profile check dates';
---
<Base title={title} description={page.intro}><div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><p class="kicker">Regional shortlist</p><h1>{page.label}</h1><p class="lead">{page.intro}</p><p class="meta-line">{matches.length} researched properties · {checkedLabel}</p></section><div class="callout">These regional pages help compare different trip bases. They are not complete hotel directories and do not show live rates. Central Goa is an editorial grouping, not an administrative region.</div><div class="hotel-list">{matches.map((hotel,index)=><HotelRow hotel={hotel} position={index+1} showPosition={false}/>)}</div>{page.region==='North Goa'&&<section class="content region-context"><h2>North Goa areas in this shortlist</h2><p>The four properties here are in Sinquerim-Candolim, Nerul, Vagator and Calangute. The Government of Goa’s North Goa beach circuit also includes Anjuna and other beaches, so this shortlist is a selection rather than a directory; it does not include a hotel in every area.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="compare-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Base</th><th scope="col">Property example</th><th scope="col">Useful distinction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sinquerim-Candolim</td><td><a href="/hotels/taj-fort-aguada-goa/">Taj Fort Aguada</a></td><td>Resort with direct access to Sinquerim Beach.</td></tr><tr><td>Nerul</td><td><a href="/hotels/ahilya-by-the-sea/">Ahilya by the Sea</a></td><td>Nine rooms across three villas; a much smaller stay than a large resort.</td></tr><tr><td>Vagator</td><td><a href="/hotels/w-goa-vagator/">W Goa</a></td><td>Resort facilities including several pools and a spa.</td></tr><tr><td>Calangute</td><td><a href="/hotels/calangute-residency/">Calangute Residency</a></td><td>GTDC-listed cottages and suites; current pool operation is not confirmed in the source checked.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>Plan around the exact beach and property</h2><p>North Goa is a beach circuit, not one compact hotel district. Check the hotel’s exact address, beach access and transport for your itinerary instead of assuming neighbouring beaches or properties are walkable. See the <a href="https://www.goa.gov.in/what_to_see/beaches/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Government of Goa beaches overview</a> for the state’s North Goa circuit, and the <a href="https://goa-tourism.com/siteseeing/beaches-of-north-goa/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Goa Tourism Development Corporation’s North Goa beach guide</a>.</p></section>}<section class="content"><h2>Choose your base with the trip in mind</h2><p>For a region-to-region comparison, read <a href="/guides/north-goa-vs-south-goa/">North Goa vs South Goa</a>. Browse the <a href="/">full ten-hotel list</a> or the <a href="/guides/best-areas-to-stay-in-goa/">area guide</a>.</p></section></div></Base>
